<title>COSTA RICA: SOCCER-COSTA RICA AND MEXICO DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COSTA RICA AND MEXICO DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica and Mexico drew 0-0</p>
<p>in a CONCACAF final stage World Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p> Standings	  P  W  D  L  F  A  PTS</p>
<p> Mexico	     2  1  1  0  4  0  4</p>
<p> Costa Rica	 1  0  1  0  0  0  1</p>
<p> Jamaica	    1  0  1  0  0  0  1</p>
<p> United States    1  0  1  0  0  0  1</p>
<p> Canada	     1  0  0  1  0  4  0</p>
<p> El Salvador	-  -  -  -  -  -  -</p>
<p>Note: United States and Canada were due to meet later on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Top three teams qualify for the 1998 World Cup in France.</p>
</text>
